  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên bất phương trình đã cho tương đương với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Kết hợp điều kiện, nghiệm của bất phương trình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên bất phương trình tương đương với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Kết hợp điều kiện, nghiệm của bất phương trình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên bất phương trình tương đương với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≥</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Kết hợp điều kiện, nghiệm bất phương trình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên bất phương trình tương đương với <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tKết hợp điều kiện, nghiệm bất phương trình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó, <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≥</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tKết hợp điều kiện, nghiệm của bất phương trình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mo>log</mo><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tKết h